hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1438","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, he said: Kathir bin Abdullah bin Amr wrote to me, narrating, on the authority of his father, on the authority of His grandfather, he said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, saying the “Allahu Akbar” on Eid al-Adha seven and five, and on Eid al-Fitr the same way."
